#### 3.2 Kalkulasi FCF & Valuasi
```
FCF (2028) = Pendapatan × (1 - Kos%) - Cukai
          = 52.3J × 0.6 × 0.76 = RM 23.8 Juta

Terminal Value (2040) = FCF × (1+g) / (r - g)
                    = 23.8J × 1.05 / (0.12 - 0.05) = RM 357 Juta

PV (2028) = Terminal Value / (1 + r)^10 = 357J / 3.105 = RM 115 Juta
```

**Nilai Pra-IPO (2028) = PV + FCF (2026–2028) ≈ RM 680 Juta** ✅

