### 🔹 2. LALUAN LATIHAN AI (Training Pipeline)

| Fasa | Aktiviti | Tempoh | Output |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Data Ingestion** | Tarik data dari Binance API, FRED, GDELT, CISA | 2 jam | Dataset mentah (JSON) |
| **Preprocessing** | Normalisasi, imputasi nilai hilang, penghapusan outlier | 4 jam | Dataset bersih (Parquet) |
| **Feature Engineering** | Teknikal: RSI, MACD, volatility; Geopolitik: rolling averages | 6 jam | Feature set (512 dimensi) |
| **Training** | Latihan model Transformer + LSTM + GNN (100 epoch) | 12 jam (A100) | Model weights (.pth) |
| **Validation** | Cross-validation (5-fold) + backtesting | 4 jam | Metrik: MSE, RMSE, F1 |
| **Deployment** | Dockerize model + API | 2 jam | Endpoint `/predict` |

**Metrik Sasaran:**
- RMSE (BTC): < 120 USD
- RMSE (ETH): < 15 USD
- F1 (sentimen geopolitik): > 0.85

