### 🔹 3. MODEL KEWANGAN TERPERINCI (Andaian & Kalkulasi)

#### 3.1 Andaian Utama
| Pemboleh Ubah | Nilai |
| :--- | :--- |
| Kadar penembusan pasaran ASEAN (2026 → 2028) | 5% → 15% |
| Kadar penukaran percubaan percuma → langganan | 20% |
| Kos operasi / Pendapatan | 40% |
| Kadar cukai korporat | 24% |
| Diskaun (WACC) | 12% |
| Pertumbuhan jangka panjang | 5% |

#### 3.2 Kalkulasi FCF & Valuasi
```
FCF (2028) = Pendapatan × (1 - Kos%) - Cukai
          = 52.3J × 0.6 × 0.76 = RM 23.8 Juta

Terminal Value (2040) = FCF × (1+g) / (r - g)
                    = 23.8J × 1.05 / (0.12 - 0.05) = RM 357 Juta

PV (2028) = Terminal Value / (1 + r)^10 = 357J / 3.105 = RM 115 Juta
```

**Nilai Pra-IPO (2028) = PV + FCF (2026–2028) ≈ RM 680 Juta** ✅

